  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PCP Kenya 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PCP Kenya 2.0 is based on the request from Government of Kenya dated to re-align the PCP to the new government structure and the new government priorities such as Bottom-up Economic Transformation Agenda (BETA) and the Medium-Term Plan (MTP) IV 2023-2027.  PCP is a comprehensive framework for accelerating inclusive and sustainable industrial development in Kenya. It outlines a strategic partnership model that leverages multi-stakeholder collaboration, focuses on high-impact priority sectors, and mobilizes large-scale investments to drive industrial growth and socio-economic transformation.</narrative>
  </description>
